00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.500
Mortgage packages
have historically

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:24.050
been a very complex
and document intensive

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.270
workflow in our economy.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:29.980
Now these mortgage packages
can be an ideal use

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.380
case for Document AI.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.730
Why?

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:37.870
Mortgage packages are
of very high volume.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:40.820
They're a mix of
structured, semi-structured,

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:42.780
and unstructured content.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:45.700
There is a lot of content
validation requirements

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.500
on these mortgage packages.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:51.120
And the same mortgage package
is analyzed over and over again

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.370
within origination,
securitization, and servicing.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.620
And sometimes multiple
business units

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.870
within the same
financial institution

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:02.090
process income and asset
documents multiple times,

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.390
leading to a lot
of inefficiencies.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:08.510
Once the mortgage package is
converted into structured data,

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:11.800
it can be fed into multiple
downstream analytical and

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.870
operational workflows.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:19.530
We at Google have
identified with our partners

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.790
and customers, various
mortgage document types that

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:27.930
fit into a typical
origination workflow

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:34.650
and bucketed into various
high value use cases.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.630
One of our first focus areas is
the income and asset document

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.690
bucket.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:46.060
I'm excited to introduce the
Lending Document AI solution.

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:50.320
This is a bundle of specialized
models focused on document

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.750
types used in mortgage lending.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.840
In a nutshell, using
Lending Document AI,

00:12:55.840 --> 00:13:00.220
a loan package can be
converted into structured data

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:04.165
by applying specialized DocAI
models built for various income

00:13:04.165 --> 00:13:09.040
and asset document types,
such as W-2s, tax forms, bank

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.330
statements, and pay stubs.

00:13:12.915 --> 00:13:17.300
I am also excited to
introduce a second Document AI

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:21.200
solution called Procure
to Pay Document AI.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:24.650
Document AI for Procure
to Pay helps enterprises

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.930
automate one of their
highest volume and highest

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:30.570
value business processes,
the procurement cycle.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:33.920
We provide a group
of AI powered parsers

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:37.460
starting with invoices and
receipts that take documents

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:43.370
